WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.510
A battle was held in 
 Biscotti territory

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.280
to welcome the Hero.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.020
Naturally, Sink was Biscotti's Hero,

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.860
Nanami was Galette's,

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.900
and a new Hero was born 
for Pastillage in Rebecca,

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.150
making things even more 
lively than ever.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.030
We're also preparing 
for the next battle

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.040
by resting and practicing, but...

00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.380
The meetings between the

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.190
three countries leaders was 
concluded successfully,

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.600
and the people from 
Pastillage and Galette

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.490
are all returning to their 
respective countries.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.030
Bye then!

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.650
See you at the next battle.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.380
Yeah!

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:22.660
Rebecca-dono and Couverte-sama 
have gone to Pastillage.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.620
You guys don't have to make 
a big deal out of this.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.210
You'll be seeing each other 
again before you know it!

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.590
But there are so many things 
I want to talk to her about.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.930
Yeah. We just became friends.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.590
Right?

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:48.230
As for Sink and Eclair, and then Noir...

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.270
they will join up with me

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.820
for our summer training 
camp near Fuugetsu Lodge!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.610
Hey!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.830
Biscotti Summer Camp!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.500
Everyone's going to be at 
the next war, too. Right?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.630
Yes. All three countries will be 
coming together for one big event.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.130
Galette, Biscotti, and Pastillage.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.430
It'll be a huge gathering with songs

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.640
and events for the general populace!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:30.640
Wow, that sounds amazing, 
like so much fun!

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.940
That's right!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.690
The citizens will have a blast,

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.110
the country will make a profit,

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.400
and the fighters will have a battlefield!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.950
It's not an easy operation, 
but it's totally worth it!

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.490
I see.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.700
Can I help, too?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.410
You sure can!

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:55.380
I think I'll have my hero, 
Rebecca, go against

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.710
Millihi-nee by singing on-stage.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.510
That was a joke.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.470
You can see Pastillage, now.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.270
Esnart is a city of refinement and art,

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:15.230
erected right on the border of Biscotti.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:18.230
There's our castle, Eschenbach!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.690
Wow, it's fantastic! Beautiful!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.700
Hero!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.160
Yes, hello guys!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.790
Nanami-sama!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.710
You're very popular, Nanami-chan.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.630
She is a Hero, after all.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.380
It would be bad for us 
if she wasn't popular.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:47.390
Leo-sama looks happy, too, now 
that she has a dependable partner.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.940
Milady, will you take your lunch soon?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.770
Oh, is it that time already?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.860
Thank you for this meal.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.780
Yes.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.660
I can't help but feel sorry
for Yuki-chan and the Hero

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.660
for having to set up an
outdoor training camp

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.120
in this kind of heat.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.500
Children love to play out in nature.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.340
That's true.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.300
Dear me!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.510
What is this ringing I keep hearing?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.510
That was a present from the Hero.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.810
In their home world, such a 
thing is called a "wind chime".

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.830
Time's up.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.290
Too bad.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.750
I guess it's a draw.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.250
Wow, you're really good, Yuki.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.920
I couldn't get a single attack in.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:07.220
Actually, you're a lot stronger 
than you were before.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.590
You think those two are still at it?

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.300
Yeah, probably.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.440
Wow, this is incredible.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.610
Looks like they clashed hard again.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.320
Eclair... are you losing?

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:37.080
No, I'd say I'm ahead.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.500
I won't stop until I'm ahead.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.960
Fine then, we can say I lost.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.170
Let's just end this already!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.260
Finally... victory.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:54.640
Your dislike for losing and your 
perseverance are peerless.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.100
It's the spirit of Galette.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.270
Eclair, are you all right?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.100
This is why I don't like fighting her.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.940
Well, it looks like everyone's 
worked up a fine sweat,

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.110
so let's go change and then 
move on to the water exercises!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.610
Okay!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.120
First one in!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.370
That was quick.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.620
Guys always change quickly.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.420
Let's change, too.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.210
Playing in the river, 
playing in the river...

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.210
It's supposed to be training.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.720
We'll be practicing swimming 
and lifeguarding skills.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:34.180
We're all pretty tired 
from our training before,

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:38.970
so we can just enjoy a little 
rest before we resume.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:41.480
If you say so, Yuki.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.520
Noir, is something wrong?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.950
I won't lose to you.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.200
One of these days...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.830
Stop fooling around and get changed!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.040
You either, Eclair!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.330
You might be leading now,

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.340
but don't get too full of yourself!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.630
Don't touch them!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.090
Don't squeeze them either!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.460
You've gotten bigger.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:16.970
Knock... it... off!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.390
Oh, no!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.110
Noir, are you okay?

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.570
I'm fine. I'm sorry, Sink.
 Are you hurt?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:38.490
I'm fine... I'm...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.210
Just stay right there, Sink.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.790
I'm going to get my bathing suit on.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.790
P-Please do...

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.630
I'll do that!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.800
All right, let's try that again.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.810
Everybody's ready!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.100
For the next 15 minutes,

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.810
you are free to rest 
and do what you like.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.810
After that, we'll move on 
to lifeguard training.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.320
Okay!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:19.580
Sink, I'm sorry about before.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.830
Oh, I'm sorry, too.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:25.160
By the way, how come you're here alone?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.630
Well, I'm the only one in Genoise

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.500
who didn't take their vacation,

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.550
but I actually wanted to learn

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.220
a bunch of things about
 monsters and cursed swords

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.850
from Yuki and Lady d'Arquien.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:40.890
Monsters?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.350
In Galette, they don't have a team

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.730
of counter-monster specialists 
like our Onmitsu Squad.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.110
So Leo-sama and Gau-sama

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.440
both suggested that I 
try to put one together.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.780
Her ladyship and I have 
been asked to cooperate.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.030
I see.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.790
It would be terrible if another 
monster like that appeared again.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.340
Oh, but if you're going to do that,

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.340
what about Genoise?

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.220
I'll continue that side 
as well, of course.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:23.010
I'm Genoise's center, and 
Gau-sama's personal guard.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.270
I see. That's good.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.770
For Gaul, of course,

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.100
but also because I want 
to play with you guys

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.610
and fight against you, too.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.820
Thanks, Sink.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.150
Jau and Vert will be happy about that.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.700
Oh yeah, would you like a drink?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.110
I'll get some.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.240
Yes, thank you.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.960
Hero, I'm telling you this 
just as a precaution:

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.090
you shouldn't get so close to 
girls from another country.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.670
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.090
Not really wrong,

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.890
it's just that you're

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.640
too relaxed around girls your age,

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.060
and your sense of space is all weird...

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.770
I'm not really sure how to put it...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:13.610
If you have time to pet a 
girl from another country,

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:18.690
pet me instead, you insensitive Hero.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.490
Something like that?

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:25.450
Noir, you stupid cat!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.880
Bright Power Release!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.180
Whoa, Eclair. A new skill!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.640
A blade made from bright 
power, the Bright Ice Blade!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.100
Don't you think that having

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.390
someone really be unconscious

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:54.440
will be beneficial for the 
lifeguard exercises?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.110
Great suggestion.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:10.370
It's so nice of you to 
want to be unconscious.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.660
Noir, you, too?!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.370
Cool!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.090
Bright Power Gear, Seven Tails!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.010
In a physical battle, you 
have the upper hand,

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.220
but when it comes to controlling 
bright power or emblem arts...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.560
I'm better!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.860
Bright Ice Blade!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.860
Light Fang Vortex!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.200
Seven Tails: Squeeze!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:11.680
Um, I guess we should
start the lifeguard exercises.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.020
Then, let's rescue the 
unconscious people first.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.520
I really wonder why these 
two always clash so hard.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.690
They're the same age,
 both personal bodyguards,

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.450
both best friends with Rico...

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:27.070
they have a lot in common.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.330
Well, they're simply great rivals.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.290
Rivals, huh?

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:38.130
I suppose your rival 
here is Prince Gaul.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.000
Yeah...

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.380
I want to play with Gaul, too.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.970
I guess he's playing with 
Nanami-dono right about now?

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.550
Yeah, you might not think so,

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.060
but Gaul's actually quite shy with girls.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.810
Gaul! Hey, Gaul!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.890
Gah, you're so persistent!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.850
So why won't you let me pet you?!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.520
You're asking why?!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.150
I won't let people just 
touch me in public!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.570
Besides, I'm actually not that

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.820
comfortable with having people touch me.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:12.240
But you're so close with 
Genoise and Leo-sama.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.990
My sister is my sister,

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.830
and those three stooges 
are basically family.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.790
Aww. Well, I'm not into forcibly 
touching those who don't like it...

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.880
All right, I won't touch you, 
so will you come down?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.220
Well, it's not like I really 
hate it that much,

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.220
but you and I are prince and hero.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:37.230
Let's try to stick to proper 
decorum and moderation.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.520
Gaul, you're so serious.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.440
All right, but is it okay 
if we become friends

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.110
as long as we observe that 
moderation and decorum?

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.950
That sounds great.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.820
Let's do this, cool as we are.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.280
Roger that.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.870
Oh, Nanami, Gaul.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.410
Leo-sama!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.370
Sister.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:02.380
I'm going to have a bit 
of time after this.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.460
Nanami, could you come to my quarters?

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.460
I have a favor to ask.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.260
Sure!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:13.180
Mmmm, Nanami, your 
technique is quite good!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.850
How about this?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.930
Oh, that's good, that's good!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.600
Violet, is it okay that 
our ruler is like this?

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.940
Yes, as long as Leo-sama 
is happy, it's okay.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.660
What do you think, Rebecca?

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.960
This is Pastillage's Crystal 
Magic research mecca!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.790
This is the main hall of the

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.960
Esnart Crystal Magic Research Institute!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.630
Everybody, it's me, Couverte!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.850
Did you watch Hero Rebecca's 
success on the broadcast?

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.940
Did you watch me, too?

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.570
I want Rebecca to really fall 
in love with Pastillage and us

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.190
until the next war!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:15.030
I want you all to love 
our Hero Rebecca, too!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.950
Will you love Rebecca as 
the Hero of Pastillage?!

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.440
Thank you!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:47.520
I will do my best as your 
Hero for all of Pastillage!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.030
Tomorrow morning, we're going 
to wrap up our training.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.540
In the afternoon, her ladyship 
will give us sword lessons.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.210
Sounds like a full course.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.580
We should go to bed soon,

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.000
so that we can start training 
while it's still cool.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:07.880
Yeah.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:11.550
So, good night, everybody.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.260
Wait, we're not doing a

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.050
"say who you're in love with"
 contest before bed?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.390
No, go to bed!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:21.640
Oh, for me that's her ladyship, 
the princess, Rico, and...

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.520
No, stop it!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.850
I don't think that's how you do it...

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.730
Go to bed, I'm tired!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.580
Eclair...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.330
You woke up, too?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.920
I woke up because Yuki was choking me.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.920
She has that hugging habit...

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.260
Happened to me a lot when we were little.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.970
Can I sit next to you?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.970
You were sleeping next to me.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.230
It's so quiet.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.560
You think so?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.440
The sound of the water and the insects...

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.230
there's plenty of noise.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:18.200
Well, it's been really lively 
ever since I got back here,

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.240
so this is quiet enough.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.910
Everybody's just happy that you're back.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.290
Whenever a letter arrived from you,

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.580
Rico nearly flipped out.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:35.340
The princess was always waiting 
for you to come back, too.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.920
And you?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.840
I'm not...

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.760
I'm happy to see you again.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:45.850
I mean the reason that my 
summoning was possible again

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.020
is because you 
accepted my wristband

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.190
and have worn it ever since.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.440
It's not like I'm the only one

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.740
who accepted an item of promise.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:07.250
I haven't had a chance

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.540
since I got back to say it properly:

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.340
I'm glad I got to see you again...

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.460
and I hope that we can

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.590
work together as a team 
again this summer.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.970
I remembered!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.020
Hero, come here for a second!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:26.930
Here?

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.390
You've pet me before.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.560
I just remembered that 
I didn't pet you back then.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.940
Um...

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.360
I am obligated to return the favor.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:41.110
Let me pet you.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.910
Roger that.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:01.220
Uh, so what's going on here?

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.380
Uh,

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.140
Eclair and Sink were talking

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.220
and exchanging friendly cuddles,

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.640
and Sink ended up on her lap.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.650
Because of their exhaustion from the 
afternoon, they passed out like that.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:14.940
I see.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.540
Eclair...

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.710
This is not what it 
looks like! Not at all!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.880
It's not what you think!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.510
Don't worry, we know.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.090
It's totally fine that you 
guys get along. Really.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.680
No! It's not like that at all!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.930
It's okay, we understand.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.930
Eclair, you're annoying.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.400
And then...

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.860
We have just returned!

00:20:58.860 --> 00:20:59.980
Thank you for having us.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.440
Show me the results

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.150
of your training camp
 once you've rested a bit.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:04.990
Okay!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.370
The training camp at the river 
ended without any problems.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.210
So this is it.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:22.380
You just copy the skill I spent 
blood, sweat, and tears to learn?!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.590
No,

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:27.430
your skill is also based on Lady 
d'Arquien's Lupine God Void Fang, right?

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.180
Since the school's the same,

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.390
it's natural that they look alike!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.770
But, still!

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.310
Really, you two, excellent work.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:39.690
I think I can soon entrust you with 
our monster sealing techniques.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:40.980
Thank you!

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.400
And of course, you, as well, Noir.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:51.990
Thus, this fun and hot summer 
moment came to a close.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.970
Idiot, idiot, idiot!
 Why didn't you wake up?!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.760
Maybe it was just comfortable.

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.000
<b>Galette Sword Style Record!</b>

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.270
Eclair, you should hold back a little.

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.690
Tune in again, next time.
